fficial YouTube channel of the Record Label \"Cafe De Anatolia\" 🐪\n\nCafe De Anatolia is a globally acclaimed independent record label and media company founded in 2017. As pioneers of Ethnic Deep House and Organic House / Downtempo, the label blends traditional sounds from the Middle East, Balkans, and Asia with modern electronic music.\n \nWith over 4,000 artists and 15,000+ released tracks, it also operates as a booking agency and music publisher through CAMELWAV, signed exclusively to Sony Music Publishing. Recognized as an Official Curator on Apple Music and Anghami, and ranked among the Top 50 Spotify Curators,the label manages 20+ YouTube brands with over 30M followers.\n\nIn 2024, Cafe De Anatolia was nominated for Beatport’s Hype Label of the Year at the IMS Awards in Ibiza and ranked #1 Best-Selling Record Label and Artist in its genre. Featured in Billboard, Forbes, DJ Mag, Entrepreneur, and Gulf News, and partnered with brands like W Hotels, Giorgio Armani, and Four Seasons.\n"},"callToAction":{"simpleText":"VISIT CHANNEL"},"dismiss":{"simpleText":"CANCEL"},"endpoint":{"clickTrackingParams":"CAUQ-N4BGAAiEwiE5rGW_fCPAxVC7kkHHfaDIP8yDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbkj8_dr9qrb6sFvKAQQmjn0v","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/channel/UC1Tr6S-XLBk1NzNX1jErWMg","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_CHANNEL","rootVe":3611,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"UC1Tr6S-XLBk1NzNX1jErWMg"}},"hovercardButton":{"subscribeButtonRenderer":{"buttonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBE"}]},"subscribed":false,"enabled":true,"type":"FREE","channelId":"UC1Tr6S-XLBk1NzNX1jErWMg","showPreferences":false,"subscribedButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBED"}]},"unsubscribedButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"SUBSCRIBE"}]},"trackingParams":"CAYQmysiEwiE5rGW_fCPAxVC7kkHHfaDIP8yDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbg==","unsubscribeButtonText":{"runs":[{"text":"UNSUBSCRIBE"}]},"serviceEndpoints":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CAYQmysiEwiE5rGW_fCPAxVC7kkHHfaDIP8yDGl2LWVuZHNjcmVlbsoBBCaOfS8=","commandMet