v","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/@CafeDeAnatolia","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_CHANNEL","rootVe":3611,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"UC1Tr6S-XLBk1NzNX1jErWMg","canonicalBaseUrl":"/@CafeDeAnatolia"}},"channelThumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_llIFWXGr_Hwi1RDw0koXI4sxVRwkFTpFRNG34eozOUhO0=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj"}]}}},{"expandableVideoDescriptionBodyRenderer":{"showMoreText":{"accessibility":{"accessibilityData":{"label":"Show more"}},"simpleText":"...more"},"showLessText":{"simpleText":"Show less"},"attributedDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Cafe De Anatolia – Andalusia | Best Andalusian, Spanish \u0026 Arabic Music (DJ Mix 2025) \n\nExperience the beauty of Andalusian music, Spanish music, and Arabic music in this exclusive Cafe De Anatolia – Andalusia 2025 collection. This is more than just a mix — it’s a journey through the heart of Andalusia, blending passionate Andalusian music traditions with vibrant Spanish music rhythms and mystical Arabic music melodies. From the flamenco-inspired soul of Spanish music to the enchanting oriental harmonies of Arabic music, every track in this Cafe De Anatolia mix is crafted to transport you to the sunlit streets of Seville, the warm Mediterranean coast, and the magical deserts of the Arab world. Whether you’re relaxing, traveling, studying, or simply enjoying world sounds, this Cafe De Anatolia mix offers the very best of Andalusian music, Spanish music, and Arabic music in 2025. Let Cafe De Anatolia – Andalusia 2025 be your soundtrack to peace, inspiration, and cultural connection.\n\n➤ Follow Cafe De Anatolia on Spotify: https://lnk.to/CDASPO\n➤ Subscribe for more: https://lnk.to/CafeDeAnatolia\n➤ Follow Cafe De Anatolia Playlists on Spotify: https://lnk.to/cdaacc\n\n🌞 Subscribe to Cafe De Anatolia 🌞:\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia: https://lnk.to/CafeDeAnatolia\n\n➤ All INFO about Cafe De Anatolia: https://solo.to/cafedeanatolia\n\n🌴 Merch: https://lnk.to/CDAMerch\n\n➤ Similar YouTube Channels: ⤵ - https://bio.to/CDAYT\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia: https://lnk.to/CafeDeAnatolia\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia ETHNO WORLD: https://lnk.to/EthnoWorld\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia LIVE: https://lnk.to/CDALive\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia LOUNGE: https://lnk.to/CDALounge\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia SONGS: https://lnk.to/CDASongs\n☛ CDA MAG: https://lnk.to/CDAM\n☛ Camel: https://lnk.to/Camela\n☛ Desert Rose: https://lnk.to/DRose\n☛ Orient Express: https://lnk.to/Orient\n☛ Rialians On Earth: https://lnk.to/rialians \n☛ Billy Esteban: https://lnk.to/BillyYTM\n\n🐪 Follow our Spotify Playlists: ⤵\n🎧 Most Beautiful Songs: https://lnk.to/1cBfeCbV\n🎧 Best Ethnic Deep House: https://lnk.to/ethno\n🎧 Oriental Deep House: https://lnk.to/OrDeep\n🎧 Cuba Cafe: https://lnk.to/cubacafe\n🎧 Cafe De Anatolia CHILLOUT: https://lnk.to/ChillSPOT\n🎧 Cafe De Anatolia LOUNGE: https://lnk.to/LoungeS\n🎧 Desert House - https://lnk.to/DHouse\n\nCafe De Anatolia – Andalusia | Best Andalusian, Spanish \u0026 Arabic Music (DJ Mix 2025)\n\n🐪 Follow our Apple Music Playlists: ⤵\n🎧 Most Beautiful Songs: https://lnk.to/dRxWuH6R\n🎧 Best Ethnic Deep House: https://lnk.to/ethnoa\n🎧 Cuba Cafe: https://lnk.to/cubacafa\n🎧 Oriental Deep House: https://lnk.to/OrDeepA\n🎧 Cafe De Anatolia CHILLOUT: https://lnk.to/ChillApple\n🎧 Cafe De Anatolia LOUNGE: https://lnk.to/LoungeA\n\n➤ Follow Cafe De Anatolia:\n☛ Official Page: https://cafe-de-anatolia.com/\n☛ Facebook: https://lnk.to/CDAFAC\n☛ Facebook Group: https://lnk.to/CDAGro\n☛ Instagram: https://lnk.to/CDAINS\n☛ SoundCloud: https://lnk.to/CDASOU\n☛ Beatport: https://lnk.to/CDABEA\n☛ CDA LAB Beatport: https://lnk.to/CDABTP\n☛ VK: https://lnk.to/CDAVKK\n☛ Twitter: https://lnk.to/CDATWI\n☛ Spotify: https://lnk.to/CDASPO\n☛ TikTok: https://lnk.to/CDATIK\n☛ Patreon: https://lnk.to/patreon\n☛ Apple Music: https://lnk.to/DJMixes\n\n➤ Follow Our Residents on Spotify:\n☛ Cafe De Anatolia: https://lnk.to/CDASPO\n☛ Billy Esteban: https://lnk.to/BillySPO\n☛ Rialians On Earth: https://lnk.to/RIASPO\n\nCafe De Anatolia – Andalusia | Best Andalusian, Spanish \u0026 Arabic Music (DJ Mix 2025)\n\n💃 Thank you for listening, we hope you will have a good time here. \nPlease subscribe so you can support artists work. \n🦋 Click here: https://bio.to/CDAYT\n\nPhoto © \n\n  All of the photos are bought from ShutterStock with a Standard License and some of them with Enhanced License. The Copyrights for the Cover Photo, Video \u0026 the Music belong to the Artists involved in this Project. \n  \n  If you have any problem with the photo, video or music, please contact us on our email before striking: contact@cafe-de-anatolia.com \u0026 and we will find a common solution. \n\n\n#CafeDeAnatolia #AndalusianMusic #SpanishMusic #ArabicMusic #Andalusia2025 #SpanishGuitar #FlamencoMusic #OrientalBeats #WorldMusic #MediterraneanVibes #EthnicHouse #ArabicBeats #AndalusianVibes #SevilleSounds #MoroccanVibes #SpanishFlamenco #DesertBeats #AndalusiaMix #ArabicMelodies #SpanishVibes #WorldFusion #EthnicGrooves #OrientalHouse #ChillWorldMusic #MediterraneanMusic #GlobalBeats #EthnicVibes2025 #SpanishAndalusianArabic #AndalusiaCafeDeAnatolia #BohoHouse #LoungeMusic #EthnoHouse #ArabicDeepHouse #OrganicHouse #TribalBeats #EthnicDance #MiddleEasternMusic #OrientalVibes #DesertSoul #NomadSpirit #GlobalHouse #AndalusianFlamenco #ArabianNights #WorldChill #EthnicChill #DeepEthnicHouse #SpanishGuitarMusic #ArabicInstrumental #AndalusianMix2025 #OrientalChill #EthnicLounge\n\n© Cafe De Anatolia","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1034,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CB4Q040EGAYiEwjL9bGW_fCPAxUZ7UkHHVj9Hy9I_P3a_aq2-rBbygEEJo59Lw==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqazJ2N3pGUnJORE9MNk1PNU16OWs0NW1uZ3Rwd3xBQ3Jtc0tsRC1mRVE1WGh3R3BkRU9BcjBZVE94cVdpS0otU0xGWUlGLUZfems2VG1Rb3FHMk80M0xzbHlXcFF3d0xEVjZuNDhGbjcwSWswX3NHQmkwenhjZFBrdGswRG12ZHc4a2tCUU9uVnNOSm9p